{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 1, :comments ["<b>In the wilderness of Sinai.</b> And in which place within it? <b>In the Tent of Meeting.</b> But before the Tabernacle was erected, the divine speech came from Mount Sinai, for from the day the Ten Commandments were given the Shechinah did not withdraw from it until after the Tabernacle was erected, as is stated in tractate Beitzah." "<b>In the second year of their going out.</b> But for other matters, the beginning of the year we count from Tishrei."], :book :numbers, :voice :chizkuni, :lang :en, :chapter 1, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T15:16:08.554396920Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}